#% text
# `slice_contour_plot3d(f, surface, [x, ...], [y, ...], [z, ...])` draws the values of a function in ten bands of colour on surfaces in a box.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# The surfaces are those of `slice_density_plot3d`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
slice_contour_plot3d(x^2 + y^2 + z^2, "CenterPlanes", [x, -1, 1], [y, -1, 1], [z, -1, 1])
